### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
###  Shop REST API — Generated
###
###  Start the server:
###    dotnet run --project path/to/project --urls "http://localhost:5201"
###
###  Then click "Send Request" above any request below.
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### ──────────── Orders ────────────

### List all orders
GET http://localhost:5201/api/orders

### Get order by Number
GET http://localhost:5201/api/orders/example-value

### Create a new order
POST http://localhost:5201/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "Number": "example-number"
}

### Action: Pay
POST http://localhost:5201/api/orders/example-value/pay
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "request": { "amount": 0, "currency": "sample" }
}

